Besides, our daughter

296
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,920
doesn't need to suffer this humiliation.

297
00:15:48,760 --> 00:15:50,280
That bastard Lin Jiming,

298
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:52,160
he's trampled on your feelings

299
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,400
and hurt your heart.

300
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:55,360
I won't let him get away with it.

301
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:14,360
Yo.

302
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:15,840
Director Liu,

303
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,120
didn't you go abroad for vacation?

304
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:21,600
Don't play dumb with me.

305
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,120
What do you think of my sister?

306
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:24,000
Ah.

307
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:26,760
A toy that you can call and dismiss at will.

308
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:29,040
You made her so sad.

309
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:30,480
You deserve it.

310
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:34,560
You don't have to tell me what to do.

311
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:35,920
Besides,

312
00:16:36,280 --> 00:16:38,080
your family gave her to me

313
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:39,880
for the sake of interests.

314
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:43,560
Yaru loves you from the bottom of her heart.

315
00:16:43,680 --> 00:16:44,880
Even if you don't like her,

316
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,200
you can't treat her like this.

317
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:47,240
From the bottom of her heart?

318
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:49,240
How much is it worth?

319
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:51,720
Don't pretend to be a good brother here.

320
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:52,560
I...

321
00:16:57,400 --> 00:16:58,520
You're looking for trouble.

322
00:17:10,720 --> 00:17:11,680
Let go of me!

323
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:12,520
Liu Yaping,

324
00:17:12,560 --> 00:17:13,440
I'm warning you,

325
00:17:13,840 --> 00:17:15,840
don't bother me with Liu Yaru's issues.

326
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:17,320
Do you understand?

327
00:17:17,320 --> 00:17:17,960
Lin Jiming!

328
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:19,480
Let go of me!

329
00:17:19,840 --> 00:17:20,760
If you have the guts,

330
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:23,040
I'll make you pay.

331
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:27,680
Fine,

332
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:29,240
do what you want.

333
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,200
But now,

334
00:17:32,320 --> 00:17:33,760
get out of my sight.

335
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:45,640
Lin Jiming,

336
00:17:46,800 --> 00:17:47,680
you've got guts.

337
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:49,280
I'll let you off

338
00:17:49,760 --> 00:17:51,160
for the sake of my sister.

339
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:52,760
I'll forget about it.

340
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:55,840
But next time...
